  - e.g.:
    ```
    <p style={
      dv(theme, (t) => {
        if (t === 'light') {
	  return { backgroundColor: '#222', color: '#fff' };
	}
	return { backgroundColor: '#fff', color: '#333' };
      })
    }>lorem ipsum</p>
    ```
